  Licence: SIL Open Font License 1.1, dist/node/fonts/OFL.txt
  Files: Inter-Regular.ttf, Inter-Bold.ttf

Unbounded (static instance, wght 400, Latin subset)
  Copyright 2022 The Unbounded Project Authors (https://github.com/googlefonts/unbounded)
  Licence: SIL Open Font License 1.1, dist/node/fonts/OFL-Unbounded.txt
  File: Unbounded-Regular.ttf

Moonhouse
  Copyright (c) 2013 by NimaVisual. All rights reserved.
  Licence: the font's own embedded licence, dist/node/fonts/moonhouse/LICENSE-NOTE.txt
  File: moonhouse/moonhouse.ttf, byte for byte as received
  Bundled at the package owner's instruction; its terms require written
  permission from NimaVisual for redistribution; confirm or replace it before
  relying on it. Removing it is one directory (src/node/fonts/moonhouse) and one
  entry in FONT_FILES (src/node/render-png.ts); the social card's display text
  then falls back to another face.

